<?xml version="1.0"?>
<tt xmlns:vt="http://namespace.itunes.apple.com/itt/ttml-extension#vertical" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:ittp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml/profile/imsc1#parameter" xmlns:tt_feature="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml/feature/" xmlns:ebutts="urn:ebu:tt:style" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:tt_extension="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml/extension/" xmlns:tt_profile="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml/profile/" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:ry="http://namespace.itunes.apple.com/itt/ttml-extension#ruby" xmlns:itts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml/profile/imsc1#styling" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xml:lang="en-US" ttp:dropMode="nonDrop" ttp:frameRate="30" ttp:frameRateMultiplier="1000 1001" ttp:timeBase="smpte" xmlns:tt="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance">
  <head>
    <styling>
      <style xml:id="normal" tts:color="white" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="normal"/>
    </styling>
    <layout>
      <region xml:id="bottom" tts:displayAlign="after" tts:extent="100% 15%" tts:origin="0% 85%" tts:writingMode="lrtb"/>
    </layout>
  </head>
  <body tts:color="white" region="bottom" style="normal">
    <div>
      <p begin="00:00:00:01" end="00:00:02:09" region="bottom">I'm rolling now, and you can talk to me.</p>
      <p begin="00:00:02:11" end="00:00:02:27" region="bottom">Okay.</p>
      <p begin="00:00:02:28" end="00:00:04:21" region="bottom">You do not have to look right into the camera.</p>
      <p begin="00:00:05:01" end="00:00:08:04" region="bottom">And, um, when I'm asking a question, kind</p>
      <p begin="00:00:08:04" end="00:00:09:13" region="bottom">of repeat the gist of the question.</p>
      <p begin="00:00:09:15" end="00:00:10:10" region="bottom">Okay.</p>
      <p begin="00:00:10:12" end="00:00:12:22" region="bottom">So if I say like, what do you love about Meredith?</p>
      <p begin="00:00:12:24" end="00:00:14:25" region="bottom">Well, I love Meredith because.</p>
      <p begin="00:00:14:25" end="00:00:17:24" region="bottom">And then if you stumble over anything</p>
      <p begin="00:00:17:25" end="00:00:21:12" region="bottom">or say something you don't like how you said it, I</p>
      <p begin="00:00:21:13" end="00:00:23:26" region="bottom">just need you to pause and then restart that sentence.</p>
      <p begin="00:00:23:29" end="00:00:27:04" region="bottom">You don't have to redo your whole answer and I can just cut it out.</p>
      <p begin="00:00:27:06" end="00:00:27:20" region="bottom">Nobody else.</p>
      <p begin="00:00:27:22" end="00:00:28:00" region="bottom">Okay.</p>
      <p begin="00:00:28:01" end="00:00:28:20" region="bottom">Nobody will know.</p>
      <p begin="00:00:28:23" end="00:00:29:07" region="bottom">Okay.</p>
      <p begin="00:00:29:09" end="00:00:30:03" region="bottom">Um, except for us.</p>
      <p begin="00:00:30:12" end="00:00:32:24" region="bottom">And yeah, that's pretty much it.</p>
      <p begin="00:00:32:27" end="00:00:33:23" region="bottom">Do you have any questions for me?</p>
      <p begin="00:00:33:25" end="00:00:34:20" region="bottom">I don't think so.</p>
      <p begin="00:00:34:22" end="00:00:38:00" region="bottom">Okay, so if you can say and spell your name for me.</p>
      <p begin="00:00:38:12" end="00:00:42:28" region="bottom">Fiona Barkley, F-I-O-N-A, B-A-R-K-L-E-Y.</p>
      <p begin="00:00:43:01" end="00:00:44:12" region="bottom">And what is your title here?</p>
      <p begin="00:00:44:14" end="00:00:46:15" region="bottom">Interim director of athletics.</p>
      <p begin="00:00:46:17" end="00:00:47:08" region="bottom">Perfect.</p>
      <p begin="00:00:47:22" end="00:00:51:01" region="bottom">Okay, so if you could tell me 1st</p>
      <p begin="00:00:51:02" end="00:00:54:16" region="bottom">thing, is what is unique</p>
      <p begin="00:00:54:29" end="00:00:57:20" region="bottom">about being a student athlete at Meredith College?</p>
      <p begin="00:00:58:26" end="00:01:02:04" region="bottom">One of the most unique things about being a student athlete at Meredith</p>
      <p begin="00:01:02:04" end="00:01:05:12" region="bottom">College is that we are in all women's college, and that the</p>
      <p begin="00:01:05:13" end="00:01:08:00" region="bottom">teams are known for who they are?</p>
      <p begin="00:01:08:02" end="00:01:11:03" region="bottom">It's not, oh, the women's team or whatnot,</p>
      <p begin="00:01:11:04" end="00:01:14:05" region="bottom">we stand alone in our right to</p>
      <p begin="00:01:14:06" end="00:01:18:15" region="bottom">be that sport and get the things that are needed</p>
      <p begin="00:01:18:15" end="00:01:20:28" region="bottom">for the team based on the strengths of that program.</p>
      <p begin="00:01:21:01" end="00:01:24:18" region="bottom">It's fun to see the women in our program excel,</p>
      <p begin="00:01:24:19" end="00:01:27:26" region="bottom">just based on their own merit, while</p>
      <p begin="00:01:27:26" end="00:01:30:09" region="bottom">Title 9 has been a huge part of the growth of athletics.</p>
      <p begin="00:01:30:11" end="00:01:34:00" region="bottom">We're unique in the fact that our teams have grown just</p>
      <p begin="00:01:34:01" end="00:01:36:11" region="bottom">as women's programs that are strong on their own.</p>
      <p begin="00:01:36:13" end="00:01:37:24" region="bottom">I love that.</p>
      <p begin="00:01:37:26" end="00:01:39:12" region="bottom">That's a great point.</p>
      <p begin="00:01:39:15" end="00:01:40:08" region="bottom">Mm hmm.</p>
      <p begin="00:01:42:05" end="00:01:45:15" region="bottom">Tell me, I know we were just talking about the support that</p>
      <p begin="00:01:45:16" end="00:01:48:19" region="bottom">we're getting, athletics are getting as from</p>
      <p begin="00:01:48:20" end="00:01:49:29" region="bottom">the institution itself.</p>
      <p begin="00:01:50:01" end="00:01:51:21" region="bottom">So, you know, tell me what does that mean?</p>
      <p begin="00:01:51:23" end="00:01:54:13" region="bottom">Like, what do you what do you feel like that translates into with having that?</p>
      <p begin="00:01:54:16" end="00:01:56:14" region="bottom">that faith put into the programs.</p>
      <p begin="00:01:56:28" end="00:01:59:29" region="bottom">In the last several years, we've seen such an amazing</p>
      <p begin="00:02:00:00" end="00:02:03:08" region="bottom">support from the administration here at Meredith, the</p>
      <p begin="00:02:03:08" end="00:02:07:21" region="bottom">executive leadership team at Meredith has shown so much excitement</p>
      <p begin="00:02:07:21" end="00:02:09:07" region="bottom">behind athletics.</p>
      <p begin="00:02:09:12" end="00:02:12:20" region="bottom">They understand the importance of what it brings to the campus community,</p>
      <p begin="00:02:12:21" end="00:02:15:22" region="bottom">but also they've provided additional resources to</p>
      <p begin="00:02:15:22" end="00:02:18:21" region="bottom">help us continue to grow, to support the student</p>
      <p begin="00:02:18:22" end="00:02:20:17" region="bottom">athletes that are here and the ones that are coming.</p>
      <p begin="00:02:20:20" end="00:02:21:20" region="bottom">Awesome.</p>
      <p begin="00:02:23:24" end="00:02:26:25" region="bottom">What are things, is there anything, like, you</p>
      <p begin="00:02:26:25" end="00:02:30:02" region="bottom">feel like, um, you hear a lot when you're talking to prospective</p>
      <p begin="00:02:30:02" end="00:02:33:01" region="bottom">students or their families that are questions or concerns, they</p>
      <p begin="00:02:33:02" end="00:02:34:22" region="bottom">maybe have about coming to America?</p>
      <p begin="00:02:35:13" end="00:02:36:18" region="bottom">Let me think of that one a second.</p>
      <p begin="00:02:39:28" end="00:02:40:08" region="bottom">Okay.</p>
      <p begin="00:02:41:02" end="00:02:44:08" region="bottom">Every student athlete that I talk with and their parents say, I'll</p>
      <p begin="00:02:44:08" end="00:02:47:15" region="bottom">have unique things that they're looking for in the college experience, but</p>
      <p begin="00:02:47:15" end="00:02:50:22" region="bottom">one of the things that always stands true with being a student athlete is</p>
      <p begin="00:02:50:23" end="00:02:53:22" region="bottom">that they walk in immediately to a community, whether it's through</p>
      <p begin="00:02:53:22" end="00:02:56:29" region="bottom">just their team or the athletics department as a whole, they're</p>
      <p begin="00:02:57:00" end="00:03:00:12" region="bottom">immediately connected to a group that are welcoming them and</p>
      <p begin="00:03:00:12" end="00:03:02:23" region="bottom">supporting them throughout their experience here at Meredith.</p>
      <p begin="00:03:03:12" end="00:03:03:17" region="bottom">Awesome.</p>
      <p begin="00:03:03:21" end="00:03:06:06" region="bottom">Um, let's see.</p>
      <p begin="00:03:06:08" end="00:03:09:11" region="bottom">What else is important for,</p>
      <p begin="00:03:09:12" end="00:03:10:28" region="bottom">do you think, recruits to hear about?</p>
      <p begin="00:03:12:19" end="00:03:15:18" region="bottom">Especially, like, thinking holistically of all the sports, you know?</p>
      <p begin="00:03:15:21" end="00:03:16:12" region="bottom">Mm hmm.</p>
      <p begin="00:03:22:23" end="00:03:24:01" region="bottom">What do you think, Ashby?</p>
      <p begin="00:03:27:11" end="00:03:31:12" region="bottom">Things important for students to know if they're considering coming to Meredith.</p>
      <p begin="00:03:34:24" end="00:03:35:04" region="bottom">The question?</p>
      <p begin="00:03:35:07" end="00:03:36:11" region="bottom">Oh, I'll answer some questions.</p>
      <p begin="00:03:36:13" end="00:03:37:11" region="bottom">Let you get behind this.</p>
      <p begin="00:03:40:17" end="00:03:41:17" region="bottom">Here comes trouble.</p>
      <p begin="00:03:41:19" end="00:03:41:29" region="bottom">Yeah.</p>
      <p begin="00:03:42:02" end="00:03:42:25" region="bottom">Seriously.</p>
      <p begin="00:03:42:27" end="00:03:44:17" region="bottom">I've already answered a couple questions.</p>
      <p begin="00:03:44:19" end="00:03:46:07" region="bottom">Director, lady.</p>
      <p begin="00:03:46:10" end="00:03:50:06" region="bottom">She transitioned from a head coach into an athletic director.</p>
      <p begin="00:03:50:08" end="00:03:53:09" region="bottom">What are some of the things about the student athletes that make you most</p>
      <p begin="00:03:53:10" end="00:03:56:04" region="bottom">proud from an administrative perspective?</p>
      <p begin="00:03:56:06" end="00:03:56:29" region="bottom">Great question.</p>
      <p begin="00:03:57:01" end="00:03:58:10" region="bottom">I know.</p>
      <p begin="00:03:58:13" end="00:03:59:08" region="bottom">It's a mess.</p>
      <p begin="00:04:00:18" end="00:04:01:03" region="bottom">Oh, man.</p>
      <p begin="00:04:01:05" end="00:04:02:28" region="bottom">She said I'm a mess.</p>
      <p begin="00:04:04:03" end="00:04:05:09" region="bottom">We'll probably keep that on the video.</p>
      <p begin="00:04:05:10" end="00:04:05:20" region="bottom">Yeah.</p>
      <p begin="00:04:05:22" end="00:04:06:14" region="bottom">She's a mess.</p>
      <p begin="00:04:07:18" end="00:04:08:29" region="bottom">She's a mess cut to look.</p>
      <p begin="00:04:11:11" end="00:04:12:00" region="bottom">In a minute.</p>
      <p begin="00:04:16:05" end="00:04:16:24" region="bottom">All right.</p>
      <p begin="00:04:17:00" end="00:04:18:23" region="bottom">Okay, you ready?</p>
      <p begin="00:04:18:26" end="00:04:22:10" region="bottom">Yeah, and you can talk a little bit about how, like, you coached here for</p>
      <p begin="00:04:22:10" end="00:04:24:21" region="bottom">a long time before moving into your current role.</p>
      <p begin="00:04:26:00" end="00:04:26:16" region="bottom">Yeah, any of that.</p>
      <p begin="00:04:26:27" end="00:04:28:04" region="bottom">Yeah.</p>
      <p begin="00:04:28:17" end="00:04:31:17" region="bottom">So as I transition, from being a coach here at</p>
      <p begin="00:04:31:17" end="00:04:34:16" region="bottom">Meredith into administration, it always sounds true that I'm</p>
      <p begin="00:04:34:17" end="00:04:36:03" region="bottom">just so proud of the student athletes.</p>
      <p begin="00:04:36:06" end="00:04:40:02" region="bottom">and all that they are able to accomplish, not only within their sport,</p>
      <p begin="00:04:40:02" end="00:04:42:15" region="bottom">but in the classroom and through their extracurricular activities.</p>
      <p begin="00:04:42:18" end="00:04:45:25" region="bottom">So many of them are involved in leadership opportunities</p>
      <p begin="00:04:45:25" end="00:04:49:12" region="bottom">on campus, as well as internships and study</p>
      <p begin="00:04:49:13" end="00:04:52:16" region="bottom">abroad and other things that just really make it for a holistic experience.</p>
      <p begin="00:04:52:18" end="00:04:55:21" region="bottom">Well, they're also excelling in the classroom,</p>
      <p begin="00:04:55:22" end="00:04:58:23" region="bottom">and maintaining high GPAs that will give</p>
      <p begin="00:04:58:24" end="00:05:01:23" region="bottom">them opportunities, should they want to carry on to graduate school or</p>
      <p begin="00:05:01:23" end="00:05:04:04" region="bottom">other types of post-back programs.</p>
      <p begin="00:05:04:28" end="00:05:06:03" region="bottom">I like the best question.</p>
      <p begin="00:05:06:05" end="00:05:07:00" region="bottom">Last one, sorry.</p>
      <p begin="00:05:07:02" end="00:05:07:12" region="bottom">Okay, great.</p>
      <p begin="00:05:07:14" end="00:05:08:05" region="bottom">No, I love it.</p>
      <p begin="00:05:08:08" end="00:05:08:23" region="bottom">Okay.</p>
      <p begin="00:05:11:08" end="00:05:14:18" region="bottom">Outside of their sports specifically, what does the athletic</p>
      <p begin="00:05:14:18" end="00:05:17:21" region="bottom">department at Meredith College offer the student athletes, in</p>
      <p begin="00:05:17:22" end="00:05:20:18" region="bottom">addition to, you know, playing with their teams and getting their academics here?</p>
      <p begin="00:05:21:03" end="00:05:24:19" region="bottom">And then we got wings up, sack, you know, standard, all those things, you know?</p>
      <p begin="00:05:25:05" end="00:05:26:01" region="bottom">volunteer.</p>
      <p begin="00:05:26:14" end="00:05:27:00" region="bottom">Mm hmm.</p>
      <p begin="00:05:27:02" end="00:05:27:10" region="bottom">Yeah.</p>
      <p begin="00:05:28:12" end="00:05:31:18" region="bottom">Outside of just their opportunity to compete in their sport, the</p>
      <p begin="00:05:31:19" end="00:05:35:19" region="bottom">student athletes here at Meredith have so many other opportunities within the athletics department.</p>
      <p begin="00:05:36:09" end="00:05:39:28" region="bottom">They have the opportunity to be a part of SAC, our NCAA</p>
      <p begin="00:05:39:29" end="00:05:43:18" region="bottom">SAC program, which is a national organization, leadership opportunity.</p>
      <p begin="00:05:43:20" end="00:05:46:25" region="bottom">We also have the Angel Standard, which is a</p>
      <p begin="00:05:46:26" end="00:05:49:29" region="bottom">culture development program that is unique to Meredith</p>
      <p begin="00:05:49:29" end="00:05:53:00" region="bottom">College, and they have opportunities to be a part of Wings</p>
      <p begin="00:05:53:01" end="00:05:56:02" region="bottom">Up, and Angel Nation, as</p>
      <p begin="00:05:56:03" end="00:05:59:08" region="bottom">well as volunteering through their team, and other</p>
      <p begin="00:05:59:08" end="00:06:01:23" region="bottom">opportunities on campus to get involved in plug-in.</p>
      <p begin="00:06:01:25" end="00:06:02:25" region="bottom">Love that.</p>
      <p begin="00:06:03:16" end="00:06:04:21" region="bottom">Those are all my questions for today.</p>
      <p begin="00:06:07:23" end="00:06:10:26" region="bottom">I'm just gonna make you come with me on all my interviews now,</p>
      <p begin="00:06:10:27" end="00:06:12:06" region="bottom">just so you know.</p>
      <p begin="00:06:12:08" end="00:06:14:05" region="bottom">You can, like, loosen up the interview.</p>
      <p begin="00:06:14:07" end="00:06:15:02" region="bottom">Yeah, she does.</p>
      <p begin="00:06:16:20" end="00:06:17:05" region="bottom">Let's see.</p>
      <p begin="00:06:17:07" end="00:06:20:19" region="bottom">Is there anything we didn't talk about that you feel like is important that we want to include?</p>
      <p begin="00:06:22:27" end="00:06:26:05" region="bottom">Um, I think some of the stuff that comes</p>
      <p begin="00:06:26:05" end="00:06:29:08" region="bottom">up in the recruiting opportunities is</p>
      <p begin="00:06:29:09" end="00:06:32:10" region="bottom">stuff that will hopefully come out in the general video</p>
      <p begin="00:06:32:11" end="00:06:35:12" region="bottom">where it's, you know, the location we talk a lot about</p>
      <p begin="00:06:35:12" end="00:06:38:20" region="bottom">the resources available to them in</p>
      <p begin="00:06:38:21" end="00:06:39:26" region="bottom">the Raleigh Triangle.</p>
      <p begin="00:06:39:29" end="00:06:43:09" region="bottom">Well, do you want to talk a little bit about that, about, like, what our</p>
      <p begin="00:06:43:10" end="00:06:45:02" region="bottom">location means for students coming here?</p>
      <p begin="00:06:45:04" end="00:06:46:08" region="bottom">Yeah, for sure.</p>
      <p begin="00:06:46:10" end="00:06:47:21" region="bottom">That's a great one.</p>
      <p begin="00:06:47:23" end="00:06:50:22" region="bottom">The location here, being in the center of Raleigh, is</p>
      <p begin="00:06:50:23" end="00:06:54:01" region="bottom">an amazing resource for our student athletes, because</p>
      <p begin="00:06:54:01" end="00:06:57:18" region="bottom">when they're looking for those internships or other opportunities, there's</p>
      <p begin="00:06:57:19" end="00:07:01:06" region="bottom">so many close by that they can get involved in, and</p>
      <p begin="00:07:01:07" end="00:07:04:17" region="bottom">that really gives them that chance to still be a part of their sport, excel</p>
      <p begin="00:07:04:18" end="00:07:08:25" region="bottom">in the classroom, but also have all those different resources at their fingertips.</p>
      <p begin="00:07:08:27" end="00:07:11:21" region="bottom">The Raleigh Triangle area is so amazing.</p>
      <p begin="00:07:11:24" end="00:07:15:13" region="bottom">And it's not only the opportunities</p>
      <p begin="00:07:15:13" end="00:07:18:12" region="bottom">that are more scholastic, but then, of course, the fun things that</p>
      <p begin="00:07:18:13" end="00:07:21:12" region="bottom">they can do in their free time, as far as, you know, going to</p>
      <p begin="00:07:21:13" end="00:07:25:00" region="bottom">football games or hockey games or whatever they might like,</p>
      <p begin="00:07:25:01" end="00:07:28:24" region="bottom">fun dinners out, all the things that the Raleigh Triangle offers.</p>
      <p begin="00:07:28:28" end="00:07:31:27" region="bottom">It's this small campus environment with the big</p>
      <p begin="00:07:31:28" end="00:07:33:16" region="bottom">college surrounding.</p>
      <p begin="00:07:34:13" end="00:07:34:26" region="bottom">I love that.</p>
      <p begin="00:07:35:10" end="00:07:35:26" region="bottom">Great job.</p>
      <p begin="00:07:36:07" end="00:07:36:27" region="bottom">Okay.</p>
      <p begin="00:07:36:29" end="00:07:39:19" region="bottom">All right, unless you have anything else, I think.</p>
      <p begin="00:07:39:22" end="00:07:41:17" region="bottom">No, we're good, no, thanks.</p>
      <p begin="00:07:47:12" end="00:07:48:26" tts:fontWeight="bold" region="bottom">Okay, all right.</p>
      <p begin="00:07:48:29" end="00:07:53:01" tts:fontWeight="bold" region="bottom">So first, I'm just gonna have you say and spell your name for me.</p>
      <p begin="00:07:53:03" end="00:07:56:29" tts:fontWeight="bold" region="bottom">Okay, Kim Scavone, S-C-A-V-O-N-E.</p>
      <p begin="00:07:57:02" end="00:07:59:24" tts:fontWeight="bold" region="bottom">Okay, and what is your title?</p>
      <p begin="00:07:59:27" end="00:08:02:07" tts:fontWeight="bold" region="bottom">I am the head softball coach.</p>
      <p begin="00:08:02:08" end="00:08:05:11" tts:fontWeight="bold" region="bottom">I'm also the senior woman administrator and the director of compliance.</p>
      <p begin="00:08:05:27" end="00:08:06:07" tts:fontWeight="bold" region="bottom">Amazing.</p>
